  "description": "Pure-managed compression primitives — bit I/O, dictionary coders (DEFLATE / LZW / LZMA / LZ4 / Snappy / Brotli / ...), entropy coders (Huffman / arithmetic / range / FSE / rANS / PPMd / context-mixing), transforms (BWT / MTF / RLE / Delta / BCJ), hashing (CRC-32C hardware-accelerated, xxHash, MurmurHash3, BLAKE2b / SHA / MD5), SIMD match-finders, and disk-image partition parsers. No native dependency on zlib / liblzma / libarchive.",
